Description: Tools for cleaning, analyzing, and visualizing agricultural
    experimental data (RCBD) and survey data. Provides smart column mapping
    (Thai/English), data quality checks, outlier detection, ANOVA with
    Duncan's multiple range test, and Thai-language plot support.
